WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:02.230
When project status is challenged,

2
00:00:02.230 --> 00:00:06.460
can you explain what supports it, what needs attention,
and who needs to respond?

3
00:00:06.460 --> 00:00:11.140
Why change? A status update is not a decision you can defend.

4
00:00:11.140 --> 00:00:15.910
Delivery may say on track, while acceptance is unconfirmed
and the forecast needs review.

5
00:00:15.910 --> 00:00:18.250
Why not existing tools? Keep what works.

6
00:00:18.250 --> 00:00:21.910
Mantiva360 focuses on the project-control gap
across delivery, evidence, cost and risk.

7
00:00:21.910 --> 00:00:26.800
Why Mantiva360? Move from Attention, to Cause,
to accountable Action, to Impact.

8
00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:31.400
Inspect the condition, correct the governed record,
then recalculate and reassess.

9
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:33.560
Why trust it? Mantiva360 shows the working.

10
00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:35.410
Deterministic controls calculate the result.

11
00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:38.130
Read-only assistance explains permitted records.

12
00:00:38.130 --> 00:00:41.200
Authorised people remain responsible
for decisions and changes.

13
00:00:41.200 --> 00:00:44.250
Why act now? Before the next steering committee,

14
00:00:44.250 --> 00:00:47.780
acceptance decision or delivery gate,
test one difficult question.

15
00:00:47.780 --> 00:00:49.320
Can you defend the next commitment?

16
00:00:49.320 --> 00:00:50.350
Mantiva360. A project decision you can defend.

17
00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:51.200
Data to Progress.

18
00:00:51.200 --> 00:00:52.330
Explore at mantiva360.com.
